Dalica portable mode

While this file sits next to dalica.exe, Dalica keeps its library (settings and index), its
thumbnail cache and its log in the "data" folder beside it, and writes nothing to %LOCALAPPDATA%.
Copy the whole folder to move Dalica with everything it knows. Sidecars (.dalica.json) still live
in your photo folders, as always.

Delete this file to use the normal per-user folder (%LOCALAPPDATA%\Dalica) instead. If the "data"
folder cannot be written (for example on a read-only drive), Dalica says so in its log and uses
%LOCALAPPDATA%\Dalica instead.
